# Copy to .dev.vars for local development (.dev.vars is gitignored).
# `npm run dev` does this for you: scripts/sync-env.mjs copies these two keys from ~/.env.
# Production: `npx wrangler secret put OPENROUTER_API_KEY` and `npx wrangler secret put ELEVENLABS_API_KEY`.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# Optional. Without it speech-to-text falls back to OpenRouter (MAI-Transcribe 2) and replies are text-only, with a warning.
# Models and the voice are wrangler.jsonc vars: STT_PROVIDER, ELEVENLABS_MODEL (default eleven_v4_turbo; eleven_v4 for max quality), ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# The private-link gate (optional). When set, /api/turn answers 401 {"error":"locked"} unless the request carries a matching
# x-app-token header. The page sends it after you open https://<your-worker>/?token=<APP_TOKEN> once (the link saves the token in that
# browser and then hides it from the address bar). Leave it empty locally: no gate. Production: `npx wrangler secret put APP_TOKEN`.
APP_TOKEN=
